{"unit_id":"SOH4C4759__dsh-pv-home#card-zh","repo":"SOH4C4759/dsh-pv-home","commit":"922c90fcfeb80e371863584f16728d9068146699","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-pv-home（DSH 插件，Web 与桌面客户端）：把一支 PV 影片作为 DSH 的全屏主页，启动或刷新时覆盖默认窗口。它通过 Host 的页面注入和媒体路由，在界面首帧显示循环影片，并可将会话选择重置到默认窗口。主要功能包括 Esc 返回、音量与静音控制、记住播放偏好、调整影片适配和标题栏配色，以及 Windows PV 屏保开关。适合想用影片装饰 DSH 启动页并保留快速返回操作的用户。需要随插件提供影片；无需 API Key 或外部账号，屏保功能需 Windows。","source":"generated","evidence":["entry.js:859","entry.js:934","src/home-screen.js:585","src/client.js:589"]}
{"unit_id":"SOH4C4759__dsh-pv-home#card-en","repo":"SOH4C4759/dsh-pv-home","commit":"922c90fcfeb80e371863584f16728d9068146699","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-pv-home turns a PV film into a full-screen DSH home page. It loops video, returns with Esc, resets to the default window, saves volume settings, and can match the title bar to the film. No API key is needed; Windows is required for the screen saver.","source":"generated","evidence":["entry.js:859","entry.js:934","src/home-screen.js:585","src/client.js:589"]}
